# Jak II: every gun aimed by the hand (LIST-0.1.9 items 3 and 4; a tester: the Peace Maker's shot "not from the
# gun", Jak II has it too), run with JAKVR_TEST_GUN=1 (the four guns) JAKVR_STATE_TRACE=1. A new game to the fortress
# exit (as jak2_gun.sim), the gun drawn (the Scatter Gun, the first the game gives), the right hand turned 40 degrees
# left of Jak's facing and 15 down, and each of the four fired: the Scatter Gun as drawn (its d-pad button would put it
# away: sim gh2b, build 123, "the game's gun 0"), then each picked by the d-pad with the left thumb on its rest (the
# game's gun 4, the Peace Maker, right; 1, the Blaster, down; 3, the Vulcan Fury, left): the Scatter Gun and the Peace
# Maker tapped, the Blaster and the Vulcan Fury held. Expect one "[vr-gun] ... by the hand"
# line for each gun's first shot (and the Vulcan Fury's flash, the Peace Maker's ball), each starting 0.00 m from the
# gun's muzzle and going 0.0 degrees off the hand's aim.
